# Wave T36 (Starfall kit): starroof — Starfall City's own roof kind.
# STARSHINGLE: overlapping shingle courses in the town style's own
# pale cyan (#bcd4da body, #dcebef lit crowns, #84a3ab seams),
# staggered course to course, strewn with sparse tiny star flecks
# in pale gold and white. Shingled courses are structurally unlike
# the Gym's banded tr-mossdeep slab (kept), the Mart's flat
# roof-slate, Lotus Cove's lavender barrel tile, Highbranch's leaf
# scales, Copperton's copper-seamed slabs and Wildflower's open
# trellis. Worn by the Space Center, Alban's house and the town's
# facade cottage. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T36-STARFALL-PLAN.md.)
PIX tile-starroof 16 16
